            "locales": {
  "en": {
    "f-heading-171666272166TlJ-text_html": "About Us",
    "f-richtext-17166627218lOuQ-text_html": "<p>At Overtake, we are passionate about Formula 1. Our store is the ultimate destination for anyone looking for authentic, high-quality clothing inspired by the exciting world of Formula 1 at the best prices.</p>\n<p>Whether you are a dedicated fan, a casual follower, or simply love the adrenaline of motorsport, we have something special for you.</p>\n<p>We offer an exclusive collection of products that capture the essence of Formula 1. From t-shirts and caps to jackets and accessories, each piece is carefully selected to ensure it meets our high standards of quality and design.</p>",
    "f-heading-1716662721BGXEH-text_html": "Our Mission",
    "f-richtext-1716662721xQJrz-text_html": "<p>Our mission is to provide Formula 1 enthusiasts with clothing that not only looks great but also offers comfort and style.</p>\n<p>We understand that being a fan is more than just watching the races; it is about being part of a global community that celebrates the spirit of competition and innovation.</p>",
    "f-heading-1716758032lMdhU-text_html": "Join Our Community",
    "f-richtext-1716758032DbXMO-text_html": "<p>We invite you to follow us on our social media and explore our collection, so you find the perfect pieces to showcase your passion for Formula 1. Whether cheering from the stands or watching from home, Overtake is here to ensure you do it in style.</p>\n<p>Thank you for choosing Overtake, we look forward to share the excitement of Formula 1 with you, one race at a time.</p>",
    "f-heading-1716815309h6ii5-text_html": "Our Story",
    "f-richtext-1716815309cc9ib-text_html": "Overtake was founded by two college friends who bonded over their shared passion for Formula 1.<br />During their university years, they often found themselves discussing races, drivers, and the latest innovations in the sport. Realizing there was a gap in the market for high-quality, stylish F1 clothing, they decided to turn their passion into a business.<br />Combining their skills and dedication, they created Overtake to bring the thrill of Formula 1 to fans everywhere through exclusive and authentic merchandise.",
    "f-heading-1716816071dJvbS-text_html": "About Us",
    "f-richtext-1716816071O1cBj-text_html": "<p>At Overtake, we are passionate about Formula 1. Our store is the ultimate destination for anyone looking for authentic, high-quality clothing inspired by the exciting world of Formula 1 at the best prices.</p>\n<p>Whether you are a dedicated fan, a casual follower, or simply love the adrenaline of motorsport, we have something special for you.</p>",
    "f-heading-1716816093Se7ky-text_html": "Our Story",
    "f-richtext-1716816093oINU1-text_html": "Overtake was founded by two college friends who bonded over their shared passion for Formula 1.<br />During their university years, they often found themselves discussing races, drivers, and the latest innovations in the sport. Realizing there was a gap in the market for high-quality, stylish F1 clothing, they decided to turn their passion into a business.\n<div><br />Combining their skills and dedication, they created Overtake to bring the thrill of Formula 1 to fans everywhere through exclusive and authentic merchandise.</div>",
    "f-heading-1716816111h9UcS-text_html": "Our Mission",
    "f-richtext-1716816111868Zu-text_html": "<p>Our mission is to provide Formula 1 enthusiasts with clothing that not only looks great but also offers comfort and style.</p>\n<p>We understand that being a fan is more than just watching the races; it is about being part of a global community that celebrates the spirit of competition and innovation.</p>",
    "f-heading-1716816134G2D3F-text_html": "Join Our Community",
    "f-richtext-1716816134pDI85-text_html": "<p>We invite you to follow us on our social media and explore our collection, so you find the perfect pieces to showcase your passion for Formula 1. Whether cheering from the stands or watching from home, Overtake is here to ensure you do it in style.</p>\n<p>Thank you for choosing Overtake, we look forward to share the excitement of Formula 1 with you, one race at a time.</p>"
  }
